   "id": "83dda561",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Pass plays had a higher median and a considerably higher upper range in 2025 than run plays do, but run plays have a much more consistent range of outcomes with less plays that don't gain or lose yardage. There are a ton of outliers that are mostly just very long plays you'd only see a couple times a game."
   ]
