  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "f80943df",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "EPA/Play shares much of the same story as yards gained, with pass plays having a considerably higher ceiling and run plays having a higher floor, as well as run plays having a higher median than pass plays."
   ]
  },
